    <item>
      <title>美加贸易战：关于关税和谈判的知识</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/23/world/canada/canada-us-trade-war-trump-carney.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[加拿大暂停了贸易谈判，引发特朗普总统对一系列加拿大商品征收 50% 的关税。马克·卡尼表示，他将“以一美元还一美元”进行报复。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/23/world/canada/canada-us-trade-war-trump-carney.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 09:47:28 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
