    <item>
      <title>中期选举感觉又回到了 2006 年</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/23/us/politics/midterms-feel-like-2006-all-over-again.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于一场不受欢迎的战争和高昂的物价激怒了选民，两党成员都认为这与民主党大获全胜的选举周期有相似之处。但很多事情都发生了变化。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/23/us/politics/midterms-feel-like-2006-all-over-again.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 09:01:57 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
